[SPEAKER_00]: And that, with the grief that she's been dealing with, has aged her considerably, especially in these last few years.

02:07.715 --> 02:15.238
[SPEAKER_00]: John is a man that's probably about 45 years old now.

02:15.278 --> 02:16.299
[SPEAKER_00]: 48 years old now.

02:16.319 --> 02:17.940
