02:42.745 --> 02:56.596
[SPEAKER_00]: However, because of her weakened state and the way she is in her grief, she has basically not been able to deal with this sickness.

02:58.998 --> 02:59.338
[SPEAKER_00]: Anyway.

03:03.826 --> 03:13.536
